# TB-030 review dashboard: the tool requirements plus the dashboard stack, pinned to the same versions as the tool lock.
# The tool-service sandbox image installs only src/tools/requirements.lock; the dashboard packages never enter it.
# Compile: uv pip compile app/requirements.in --generate-hashes --output-file app/requirements.lock --python-version 3.14
# Install into the tools environment: uv pip sync app/requirements.lock --python .venv-tools/bin/python
-r ../src/tools/requirements.in
-c ../src/tools/requirements.lock
